          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP214 Acadia Valley [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bit of an odd spot for a sturdy survey manhole, but easy enough to find, and there’s plenty of good parking on the nearby road! The tricky part was the pry/prop/flip, which I managed after a few tries. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
