          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP214 - Acadia Valley [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The manhole was pretty covered over with grass clippings and dirt, having not been found in about four years.  I read the previous logs so I brought a wrench with me to ground zero which I was able to use to pry the cover off to expose the pin down inside the hole.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
